      "description": "<p>TV producer, who was in relationship with ex-comedian that reportedly ended in 2014, accuses him of ‘violence, coercive control and abuse’  </p><ul><li><p><a href=\"https://www.theguardian.com/news/2026/nov/09/russell-brand-sentenced-rape-sexual-assault\">Russell Brand sentenced to more than 10 years in prison for rape and sexual assault</a></p></li></ul><p>Jemima Goldsmith has said Russell Brand physically assaulted her and she accused him of “violence, coercive control and abuse”.</p><p>The 52-year-old TV producer said she has always been “strongly and unequivocally” on the side of <a href=\"https://www.theguardian.com/news/2026/nov/09/russell-brand-victims-impact-statements\">Brand’s victims</a> as she opened up about her own “painful” experience with her former partner in a social media post on Monday.</p> <a href=\"https://www.theguardian.com/news/2026/nov/09/jemima-goldsmith-says-ex-partner-russell-brand-physically-assaulted-her\">Continue reading...</a>",
      "source_name": "The Guardian World",
